  "details": "Currently the Networking class provides the getter for the \"LocalPlayer\". This only makes sense to a certain degree. \nAll other \"player getters\" are provided by the VRCPlayerApi class which makes it inconsistent and confusing.\nThe LocalPlayer getter method should therefore either be moved or at least included in the VRCPlayerApi class. \nThis also makes it more intuitive as youre getting a player api from the player api class, which makes more inherent sense, than calling into a class called 'Networking'.",
